#	contactor ring of NCs all powered off = OK, good to go. this is done in hardware with the wire series 169/Y1 - 174/Y2.
#	front-panel Estop switch not in = OK, good to go. this is wire 119 to inmux.00.input-08-not 
# 	AXIS interface Estop switch not on = Ok, good to go. this is software only, maybe iocontrol.0.user-enable-out 
#	(for future: all of 64/188, 80/1004, 54/188 estop loops on front-panel rotary keyswitch active = Ok, good to go.)
# 	all 3 = machine is not in estop, can be powered on. 
#	power on pressed = PNOZ relay 'go' contacts closed. this signal is on-switch.
#	great, we're up and running, ready to press the machine power on button. 
#	any contactor goes down = estop, we've lost power, tell lcnc and do an Estop
#	front-panel Estop switch pressed = estop by op, tell lcnc and do an Estop
#	AXIS interface Estop switch pressed = estop by op, tell lcnc and do an Estop
#	(for future: any of 64/188, 80/1004, 54/188 estop loops on front-panel rotary keyswitch broken = tell lcnc and do an Estop.)
#	estop condition cleared: we're good to go again. 

loadrt		oneshot names=pnozv_onswitch
loadrt		estop_latch 

addf		estop-latch.0 servo-thread
addf		pnozv_onswitch servo-thread
setp		pnozv_onswitch.width 0.5

net estop-front-panel	[HMOT](CARD0).inmux.00.input-08
net estop-front-panel	estop-latch.0.fault-in

net estop-axis-gui		iocontrol.0.user-enable-out
net estop-axis-gui		estop-latch.0.ok-in

net estop-safed			iocontrol.0.emc-enable-in 
net estop-safed			estop-latch.0.ok-out
net estop-safed			[HMOT](CARD0).[HMOT](CARD1).output-14

net estop-reset			estop-latch.0.reset
net estop-reset			iocontrol.0.user-request-enable 

net	machine-is-enabled	pnozv_onswitch.in 
net	machine-powerup 	pnozv_onswitch.out
net	machine-powerup		[HMOT](CARD0).[HMOT](CARD1).output-15

net machine-is-enabled	<=  motion.motion-enabled

#when machine is ready to move: turn on z amp/pid/pwm, delay 0.2 sec, then release brake. 
#when machine has to stop: apply brake, delay 0.2 sec, then switch off amp/pid/pwm. 

loadrt timedelay count=2

addf timedelay.0 servo-thread
#addf timedelay.1 servo-thread

setp timedelay.0.on-delay 1
setp timedelay.0.off-delay 0
#setp timedelay.1.on-delay 0
#setp timedelay.1.off-delay 1

net z-enable 			timedelay.0.in
net z-brake-release		timedelay.0.out
#net z-enable			timedelay.1.in
#net z-enable-delayed	timedelay.1.out => [HMOT](CARD0).pwmgen.02.enable 

